{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>For in the matter wherein they dealt presumptuously against them.</b> It refers back to <b>״עתה ידעתי כי גדול ה׳״</b> (now I know that HaShem is great) — that is, when He showed His greatness <b>in the matter wherein</b> the Egyptians <b>dealt presumptuously</b> <b>against them</b> at first. And thus it says: ״כי ידעת כי הזידו עליהם״ (for you know that they dealt presumptuously against them)."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:58:32.532591662Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}